    "b-20-gate-exact-tail-repair-operating-procedure-for-2": {
      "id": "b-20-gate-exact-tail-repair-operating-procedure-for-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Operating procedure for monitoring a melee run for stuck \"Gate-Exact Tail\" targets (worker reached an exact match but QA gates rejected it and the repair tail exhausted), repairing them to gate-clean with sub-agents, applying the fixes to the live session tree, and capturing the knowledge as worker reports. Written 2026-07-12 after a 46-target campaign (42 exact-clean, 4 documented policy blockers)."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
